nd the bless-mark reader returns both rows.\n\n**One advisory, not blocking:** TC-242's Method says \"a loop lane whose claim record cannot be read\". When the claim can't be read, the slot can't yet know it is a loop lane. The tests and the Expected text make clear it means any lane, so a later edit could just say \"a lane\".\n\n**For the later act turn:** re-attest LLR-248 and TC-242. No row is held and none is returned. I edited no registry cell, and the sitting stops at this verdict."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":609,"cache_read_input_tokens":74552,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":609},"output_tokens":750,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"73ae5cf9-d335-4bb7-a08f-7631da597f26","uuid":"968dd8ee-994f-4c76-bf18-c66f445c80f6","timestamp":"2026-10-19T04:41:49.535Z","request_id":"req_011CgAyvQw3GWy8qKnwSrBPX"}
